      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "これぞまさに「伝説の詩人」の作に相違ない。\nよく探し出してくれた、感謝をさせてもらう。\n以後は、このシロッコを頼るがいい。\nお呼びとあらば、いつでも疾風の如く参じよう。",
        "official_en": "Yes, this is indeed the legendary poet's work!\nYou have my thanks for finding it—and my\nallegiance, should you want it. Call upon me and\nI will be there swift as a gale.",
        "real_en": null
      },
